us grove with more than 400 Valencia orange trees and a pond.","evidence_claim":"CSUN says the Orange Grove is used for research and provides a scenic, tranquil place to visit, socialize, and study.","source_url":"https://www.csun.edu/node/195321","source_title":"CSUN Orange Grove and Pond","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The university’s properties listing identifies Orange Grove as a limited-use space available 7:00 a.m. to dusk; follow posted campus rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-oviatt-lawn","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Oviatt Lawn","title":"Oviatt Lawn","subtitle":"Open space by the University Library","notes":"Make this a simple outdoor meeting point before heading into the library. The university’s open-spaces page provides a useful visual reference for locating the lawn.","short_summary":"A named lawn beside CSUN’s central library area.","evidence_claim":"CSUN’s official open-spaces and gardens page identifies Oviatt Lawn as a campus location and provides a photo gallery for it.","source_url":"https://www.csun.edu/licensing/open-space-gardens","source_title":"Open Spaces & Gardens | California State University, Northridge","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor-space use may be affected by scheduled university activities; observe posted access guidance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-library-learning-commons","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Library Learning Commons","title":"Library Learning Commons","subtitle":"University Library main floor","notes":"Bring a group task here: use an open collaborative table or ask at the desk for research and technology support. Check the library’s current service hours befo