up Study Room","subtitle":"University Library second floor","notes":"Reserve this room when your group needs a shared touch display for planning, presenting, or a remote meeting. Confirm availability through the library’s booking system.","short_summary":"A reservable group room with a large interactive display and built-in collaboration tools.","evidence_claim":"CSUN says UL 225 is an Interactive Display Group Study Room with a touch-screen 4K display, webcam, and capacity for up to eight students.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/technology/interactive-collaborative-study","source_title":"Interactive/Collaborative Study Areas | CSUN University Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservation is required; the library notes a temporary technology limitation for UL 224, not UL 225.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-gohstand-leisure-reading-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Robert and Maureen Gohstand Leisure Reading Room","title":"Robert and Maureen Gohstand Leisure Reading Room","subtitle":"University Library second floor, West Wing","notes":"Choose this room when you want a designated reading environment rather than a group-work table. Pair a reading break with the nearby library exhibit gallery.","short_summary":"A quiet second-floor room specifically designated for reading.","evidence_claim":"CSUN’s catalog identifies the Robert and Maureen Gohstand Leisure Reading Room as a quiet space specifically designated for reading.","source_url":"https://catalog.csun.edu/about/colleges/lib/","source_title":"Library | CSUN Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in the University Library; check building hours before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","u