us grove with more than 400 Valencia orange trees and a pond.","evidence_claim":"CSUN says the Orange Grove is used for research and provides a scenic, tranquil place to visit, socialize, and study.","source_url":"https://www.csun.edu/node/195321","source_title":"CSUN Orange Grove and Pond","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The university’s properties listing identifies Orange Grove as a limited-use space available 7:00 a.m. to dusk; follow posted campus rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-oviatt-lawn","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Oviatt Lawn","title":"Oviatt Lawn","subtitle":"Open space by the University Library","notes":"Make this a simple outdoor meeting point before heading into the library. The university’s open-spaces page provides a useful visual reference for locating the lawn.","short_summary":"A named lawn beside CSUN’s central library area.","evidence_claim":"CSUN’s official open-spaces and gardens page identifies Oviatt Lawn as a campus location and provides a photo gallery for it.","source_url":"https://www.csun.edu/licensing/open-space-gardens","source_title":"Open Spaces & Gardens | California State University, Northridge","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor-space use may be affected by scheduled university activities; observe posted access guidance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-library-learning-commons","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Library Learning Commons","title":"Library Learning Commons","subtitle":"University Library main floor","notes":"Bring a group task here: use an open collaborative table or ask at the desk for research and technology support. Check the library’s current service hours before going.","short_summary":"The library’s large main-floor hub for group study, technology, and research help.","evidence_claim":"CSUN identifies the Learning Commons as a main-floor collaborative space with study areas, computers, printing, technology support, and librarian help.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/learning-commons","source_title":"Learning Commons | CSUN University Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Collaborative tables and glassed-in multi-user spaces are first-come, first-served; some services have separate hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-creative-maker-studio","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Creative Maker Studio","title":"Creative Maker Studio","subtitle":"Learning Commons, Main Floor West Wing","notes":"Start a small media or fabrication project here: ask about 3D printing, audio, crafting, VR, or equipment checkout. Bring your current CSUN ID for student services.","short_summary":"CSUN’s library makerspace for hands-on multimedia design, prototyping, and creation.","evidence_claim":"The University Library says the Creative Maker Studio gives currently enrolled CSUN students multimedia design and production tools, support, and makerspace resources at no extra cost.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/technology/cms","source_title":"Creative Maker Studio | CSUN University Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Available to currently enrolled CSUN students; service hours and some equipment policies apply.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-ul-225-interactive-display-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"UL 225 Interactive Display Group Study Room","title":"UL 225 Interactive Display Group Study Room","subtitle":"University Library second floor","notes":"Reserve this room when your group needs a shared touch display for planning, presenting, or a remote meeting. Confirm availability through the library’s booking system.","short_summary":"A reservable group room with a large interactive display and built-in collaboration tools.","evidence_claim":"CSUN says UL 225 is an Interactive Display Group Study Room with a touch-screen 4K display, webcam, and capacity for up to eight students.","source_url":"https://library.csun.edu/technology/interactive-collaborative-study","source_title":"Interactive/Collaborative Study Areas | CSUN University Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Reservation is required; the library notes a temporary technology limitation for UL 224, not UL 225.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-gohstand-leisure-reading-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Robert and Maureen Gohstand Leisure Reading Room","title":"Robert and Maureen Gohstand Leisure Reading Room","subtitle":"University Library second floor, West Wing","notes":"Choose this room when you want a designated reading environment rather than a group-work table. Pair a reading break with the nearby library exhibit gallery.","short_summary":"A quiet second-floor room specifically designated for reading.","evidence_claim":"CSUN’s catalog identifies the Robert and Maureen Gohstand Leisure Reading Room as a quiet space specifically designated for reading.","source_url":"https://catalog.csun.edu/about/colleges/lib/","source_title":"Library | CSUN Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in the University Library; check building hours before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-quiet-study-lounge","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Quiet Study Lounge","title":"Quiet Study Lounge","subtitle":"University Library fourth floor, East Wing","notes":"Head upstairs when you need an individual-work setting. Use a study pod or charger-equipped seat, and keep the visit aligned with the floor’s quiet-study designation.","short_summary":"A fourth-floor individual study lounge with study pods and built-in chargers.","evidence_claim":"CSUN’s catalog states that the fourth floor is designated for quiet individual study and that the Quiet Study Lounge includes individual study pods and built-in chargers.","source_url":"https://catalog.csun.edu/about/colleges/lib/","source_title":"Library | CSUN Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in the University Library; library hours vary by academic period.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-art-galleries","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"CSUN Art Galleries","title":"CSUN Art Galleries","subtitle":"Campus Map E6","notes":"Check the current exhibition, then give yourself time to look closely and discuss one work with a friend. Confirm gallery hours before you make the walk.","short_summary":"Campus galleries presenting exhibitions and programs for the CSUN and San Fernando Valley communities.","evidence_claim":"CSUN says its Art Galleries serve the campus and larger San Fernando Valley communities, and that admission to all gallery spaces and programs is free for everyone.","source_url":"https://w2.csun.edu/mike-curb-arts-media-communication/art-galleries/about","source_title":"About | CSUN Art Galleries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official page lists regular weekday hours plus appointment-only Friday and Saturday access; exhibitions may change.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csun-oasis-wellness-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Oasis Wellness Center","title":"Oasis Wellness Center","subtitle":"University Student Union, below the Computer Lab","notes":"Register before your first visit, then use the center’s relaxation and wellness resources in a way that fits your schedule. Review facility guidelines before arriving.","short_summary":"A USU wellness destination with relaxation spaces, programs, and wellness resources for CSUN students.","evidence_claim":"CSUN describes the Oasis as a University Student Union wellness destination with nap pods, massage and relaxation chairs, guided meditation, classes, and workshops.","source_url":"https://w2.csun.edu/oasis","source_title":"Oasis Wellness Center | USU | CSU Northridge","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current CSUN students can use the Oasis after registering; official pages list separate fall/spring and summer hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
